# Surface and navigation

Use when a Business Workspace or Consumer Portal needs a formal entrypoint. Freeze the navigation and identity matrices first; store stable `business.*` route keys in Business menu routes, keep paths/components in the project Route Registry, and prove persisted role menus plus effective-menu resolution. `deep_link_only` routes remain registered without menu records.
# Report export

Use for operational reports and governed files. The bounded-pagination/threshold-routing/fingerprint-replay contract is owned by [reports](../../references/capabilities/reports.md) — apply it, do not restate it here.

Pattern-specific selectors: use Report-owned `query_predicates`/`tag_predicates` for stable page selectors, then intersect them through Export Control `allowed_query_keys`/`allowed_tags`. Never accept a request field/operator/query fragment directly. For current-revision datasets, use `field_equalities` when identity requires more than one column and declare truthful cardinality; keep legacy `left_field`/`right_field` only for single-key joins.

